189
00:12:19.958 --> 00:12:22.666
Oh. look. Doofus with the boat has a sign.

190
00:12:23.666 --> 00:12:25.416
Is that how you spell aliens?

191
00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:26.875
No. honey. it's not.

192
00:12:26.958 --> 00:12:29.166
Why would aliens wanna lock us all
in our houses?

193
00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.750
They wouldn't. honey.

194
00:12:37.166 --> 00:12:38.416
"The whole world?"

195
00:12:50.041 --> 00:12:52.000
Okay. everybody. look at me.

196
00:12:52.083 --> 00:12:54.833
We are safe. We are in our home.

197
00:12:54.916 --> 00:12:58.708
We have everything we need here.
but most importantly. we have each other.

198
00:12:59.291 --> 00:13:02.291
- Can I have a donut?
- No. Eat your spaghetti.

199
00:13:02.791 --> 00:13:04.083
But I wanna stress eat.

200
00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.625
How do you know about stress eating. Ruth?

201
00:13:07.208 --> 00:13:08.416
Graham.

202
00:13:14.541 --> 00:13:17.875
If you can make it in there.
I can make it out here.

203
00:13:18.916 --> 00:13:21.583
Do you think
the running woman has found help?

204
00:13:21.666 --> 00:13:24.125
Someone's gonna come. I promise.

205
00:13:24.208 --> 00:13:26.041
I think it was the rain.

206
00:13:26.541 --> 00:13:28.166
The rain did this.

207
00:13:28.666 --> 00:13:31.625
No. baby. it's just rain.

208
00:13:33.333 --> 00:13:35.583
We'll be fine. I promise.

209
00:13:35.666 --> 00:13:38.625
The rain looked different today.

210
00:13:39.791 --> 00:13:42.083
I'm trying to keep it together for the kids.

211
00:13:42.583 --> 00:13:45.958
But what the hell's going on. Jason?
How is this real? Like. honestly. how?

212
00:13:46.041 --> 00:13:48.541
- I don't know.
- Oh my God. My parents.

213
00:13:48.625 --> 00:13:50.541
They must be freaking out right now.

214
00:13:50.625 --> 00:13:53.083
The Richardsons across the street?

215
00:13:53.166 --> 00:13:54.333
They're okay. right?

216
00:13:54.416 --> 00:13:56.500
I'm sure your parents are okay too.

217
00:13:56.583 --> 00:13:57.666
You're right.

218
00:13:59.208 --> 00:14:00.833
I need to show you something.

219
00:14:13.125 --> 00:14:14.291
